  "description": "At the Royal Academy of Magic, Lariet Blackwood has it all. She has a brilliant mind, flawless looks, and unmatched magical skill. Her only flaw is Demian Dominique, her infuriating rival. One day, the two fall victim to the wicked scheme of a creature called Lustmouth and find themselves trapped inside a mysterious labyrinth with a deadly mission to complete. If they fail to carry it out, they die. Thus begins a dangerous game that tests their lives, their love, and their deepest desires.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
